  DisplayName: An American Heiress Comes Shopping
  EventType: 1
  Description: The daughter of an American railway fortune {has arrived|will arrive}
    in Europe with a new title and an empty house on Fifth Avenue. Her people {are
    buying|will buy} old English and French pieces by the roomful, and the dealers
    who reach her first {name|will name} their own price.
